# Context filter for Dockerfile.prebuilt ONLY (BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore).
# Unlike the main .dockerignore, this ADMITS the host-built .next output — that's the whole
# point of the prebuilt variant. Everything not needed by its three COPYs is excluded so the
# context stays small.
*
!.next/standalone
!.next/static
!public
!version.json
# The standalone bundle itself never needs the cache dir.
.next/standalone/.next/cache
